    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d108-a3">

                <pb facs="0221" n="141" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg141"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Schested to Mr.
                            Swenson.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-05-07"><hi rendition="#italic">May 7,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: Replying to your note of March 16
                    last, requesting permission for Charles C. Rönnow, a Mormon missionary, to visit
                    Denmark, on a short sojourn, I have the honor to inform you that my colleague
                    the minister of justice, finds no objection to granting the desired
                    permission.</p>
                <p>I avail, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schested.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
